  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Öffnen Sie die Türen unseres kleinen Hotelrestaurants und machen Sie sich bereit\r\ndarauf, so verwöhnt zu werden, wie Sie es verdient haben!"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Open the doors of the hotel in the heart of Beaufort and enjoy your stay with family or friends in a cozy and relaxed atmosphere. 20 cozy or family rooms and 2 dormitories of 6 people each.\r\nRestaurant with a bistro kitchen, lounge-bar to relax, children’s play room, meeting spaces for 12 people, bicycle and motorcycle room, ski storage, large secure garage, private parking.. \r\nWe thought of everything to make your stay memorable."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Aprite le porte del nostro piccolo hotel-ristorante e preparatevi ad essere\r\nad essere coccolati come meritate!"
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Poussez les portes de notre petit hôtel-restaurant et préparez vous\r\nà être chouchouté comme vous le méritez !"
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Stap binnen in ons kleine hotel-restaurant en laat u verwennen zoals u verdient!"
    ],
    "es": [
      "Abra las puertas de nuestro pequeño hotel-restaurante y prepárese para ser\r\n¡a ser mimado como se merece!"
    ]
  },
